    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"El \"},{\"text\":\"equipo de buceo\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"105257561073EEA6\"}},{\"text\":\" de Mekanism, la \"},{\"text\":\"máscara de saco de aire\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7EC5A8EB7739C9DF\"}},{\"text\":\" de Starlight y la \"},{\"text\":\"armadura de Neptuno\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"51FC5C91B5544463\"}},{\"text\":\" del Aether\"}]"
